## 2. Production telemetry (read-only SQL against oasis_events)
   Per-cohort p50/p90 of vtid.live.session.start -> model_start_speaking,
   split by auth state (presence of orb.live.context.bootstrap), provider
   (nova-specific diag stages vs vertex_tool_catalog_trimmed /
   session_resumption_armed), language and wake_opener.
   Results are tabulated in acceptance.md.

   NOTE ON A CORRECTED STEP: an earlier pass inferred "vertex" from the ABSENCE
   of a provider field on orb.live.diag. That is wrong — only nova-specific
   stages carry `provider` at all — and it mislabelled es/fr/ru cascade sessions
   as vertex. The tables in acceptance.md come from the corrected query, which
   resolves the provider from positive markers only.

## 3. Measured the real tool catalog (jest harness, local)
   buildLiveApiTools('authenticated', '/community', 'community', null)
     -> 290 declarations, 226,852 bytes (221.5 KB)
   buildLiveApiTools('authenticated', '/admin', 'admin', 'admin')
     -> 134 declarations, 45,542 bytes (44.5 KB)
   Priority set present in the real catalog -> 35/35 tools, 59,683 bytes (58.3 KB)
     at 48 KB budget: 28/290 decls, missing priority = resolve_recipient,
       log_water, log_sleep, log_exercise, log_meditation,
       get_pillar_subscores, get_vitana_index, explain_feature
     at 64 KB budget: 41/290 decls, 65,521 bytes, missing priority = NONE
   -> this is why the Nova default is 64 KB and not the bridge's 48 KB.

