## 7. Deliberate test updates (not worked around)
   Three pre-existing source-locator assertions broke because this change moved
   the thing they were matching on. Each was updated to assert its REAL
   invariant, with a comment saying why:
   - vertex-tool-catalog-budget.test.ts: asserted the block is gated on
     `=== 'vertex'`. Now asserts it keys on the resolved PROVIDER and never on
     language — which is the invariant that test exists to protect.
   - staging-nova-prewarm-flag-pinned.test.ts / staging-ws-transport-flag-pinned.test.ts:
     asserted the flag NAME is absent from the prod workflow. The prod workflow
     now documents why those two are deliberately unpinned, so they assert the
     absence of the jq PIN instead.
   - guided-topic-audio-bridge.characterization.test.ts: located
     `await sendGreetingAudioBridge(session);`. VTID-04100 wrapped that call in
     withBootstrapTimeout, so it now locates the call and still asserts the
     ordering (greeting bridge -> guided-topic bridge -> connect).

